  "brief": { "zh": "取出东站货箱里的包裹，再到箱子右边的出口交货。上方天桥有一扇钥匙门，下方地道有一道激光和一个断电开关。任选一条路线，移动和开箱各用一回合。", "en": "Collect the parcel from the east station chest and deliver it to the exit just to its right. The upper bridge has a gate that needs a key. A laser guards the underpass and a floor switch cuts its power. Either route counts. Each move and each pickup takes one turn." },
